=== Cultists ===
[[File:Cultist.png|thumb]]
==== Soul Fragments ====
When Cultists create a full set of fragments, they are automatically transmuted into a single fragment of a higher tier soul. There are 12 fragments in a red soul, 15 in orange, 19 in yellow, 19 in green, 20 in blue, 21 purple, and finally 21 in white. No additional fragments are made after a white set is completed.

This mechanic is how purple and white souls are able to made, since fragments for those colors cannot be made directly.

==== Soul Color Requirements ====
Each individual cultist may only gather fragments for one soul at a time and has to be at a certain level to allow them to farm higher quality soul fragments, up to blue.
