=== Acolytes ===
[[File:Acolyte.png|thumb]]
==== Soul Generation ====
Each individual Acolyte's efforts can be combined to increase the total chance a soul is created and the amount of souls made. There is no limit to the amount of souls that can be made at once, but the success rate is capped at 100%.

==== Soul Color Requirements ====
Acolytes are able to focus on any two adjacent soul colors at once, but can only create higher tier souls once Spiriting has reached a certain level.
